WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.784
Unit two. Internet Basics!

2
00:00:04.685 --> 00:00:09.528
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.578 --> 00:00:13.217
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.057
Today we learn about Internet Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.061 --> 00:00:22.728
Web browser. Say it with me. Web browser!

6
00:00:26.161 --> 00:00:30.328
Search engine. Say it with me. Search engine!

7
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:37.273
Link. Say it with me. Link!

8
00:00:40.784 --> 00:00:45.451
Address bar. Say it with me. Address bar!

9
00:00:48.944 --> 00:00:53.100
Homepage. Say it with me. Homepage!

10
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.721
Download. Say it with me. Download!

11
00:01:04.221 --> 00:01:08.054
Upload. Say it with me. Upload!

12
00:01:11.494 --> 00:01:15.469
Connection. Say it with me. Connection!

13
00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:34.467
I use a web browser and a search engine to find information online. Clicking a link takes me to a new page, and typing in the address bar takes me to the homepage. I can download or upload a file if I have a good connection.

14
00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:37.760
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:44.020
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.220
Link!

17
00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:51.449
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.499 --> 00:01:52.649
Upload!

19
00:01:53.731 --> 00:02:01.278
Did you know? The very first website ever made is still online today, and anyone can visit it!

20
00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:03.893
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.606 --> 00:02:13.541
Think and answer. What is the difference between downloading and uploading?

22
00:02:13.591 --> 00:02:14.741
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.762 --> 00:02:21.536
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.586 --> 00:02:24.804
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

